    "Initial API compilation failed before tests on an UPDATE accessor used for DELETE; assertion changed to deleted_rows only.",
    "First strict run found a duplicate fixture module and unnecessary clone; import actual existing owner with narrow visibility and use slice::from_ref. No source/golden construction changes.",
    "Named production DecimalPlaces constants and imported InspectError before final focused checks; values and control flow unchanged.",
    "First CLI source build failed before tests because integration-root modules needed explicit paths. Path attributes only changed, both parent predecessors preserved.",
    "Combined strict retry found an unrelated mixed-source range loop. Equivalent enumeration correction remains separate mixed-source work; corrected strict passes.",
    "Final formatter removed terminal blank lines from two CLI source owners after checks; behavior and golden construction unchanged."
  ],
